==Portuguese==
[[File:Goias in Brazil.svg|thumb|Goiás, Brazil]]
{{wikipedia|lang=pt}}

===Etymology===
From earlier {{m|pt|Goyaz}}, of uncertain origin. Possibly from {{der|pt|tpw|-}}, meaning "equal individual" or "people of same origin". Some traditions refer to a mythical tribe called the "Goiases".

